{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39401","headline":"南阳小将张彦硖口镇税人场射虎歌 · 韦庄","name":"南阳小将张彦硖口镇税人场射虎歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内昔年狎太平，横目穰穰何峥嵘。\n天生天杀岂天怒，忍使朝朝喂猛虎。\n关东驿路多丘荒，行人最忌税人场。\n张彦雄特制残暴，见之叱起如叱羊。\n鸣弦霹雳越幽阻，往往依林犹抵拒。\n草际旋看委锦茵，腰间不更抽白羽。\n老饕已毙衆雏恐，童稚揶揄皆自勇。\n忠良效顺势亦然，一劒猜狂敢轻动。\n有文有武方爲国，不是英雄伏不得。\n试徵张彦作将军，几个将军愿策勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}